---
// residue-ui's art, for the hero slot of its <Tool>: the app's window from
// the hero of residue-ui's README, docs/assets/hero-dark.svg in
// whiteheap/residue-ui (whiteheap/residue-ui#6 at 293b0aa), copied path for
// path in its own units, one unit to a cell. The hero draws the same window
// in its light and dark palettes. Only the pattern's id differs, so that no
// other element on this page can share it. It is static markup: no script,
// no motion. Change it when the hero changes.
---

